  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>It is linear differential equation so,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now solution is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>We get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get the equation as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;in equation we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
